{"3427990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spell Magic", "steam_appid": 3427990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling adventure in various procedurally generated open worlds, where magic and mathematics collide. In Spell Magic, you'll craft and master powerful spells using the fundamental forces of arithmetic, geometry, and algebra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a skilled <i>mathemagician</i>, you'll explore a vast, ever-changing realm, teeming with fearsome monsters and challenging puzzles. Your quest is to unravel the secrets of the mystical arts, harnessing the power of numbers to bend reality to your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Procedurally Generated Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you play, the world is reborn, offering a fresh experience. Various options to customize any new game are available. Options such as starting with any available upgrades or any amount of gold. Various modes all the way from permadeath to invincible exist with many more in-between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/48bf0f991c5223aa18b3a1ad3d1cff13.poster.avif?t=1788219693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/48bf0f991c5223aa18b3a1ad3d1cff13.webm?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/48bf0f991c5223aa18b3a1ad3d1cff13.mp4?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Your Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine mathematical concepts to create an arsenal of unique spells. Experiment with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geometric patterns for your shields and projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Algebraic equations to create perfectly placed elemental attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vector arithmetic to warp the 3rd dimension with your movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, learn new mathematical techniques and concepts to expand your spellcasting repertoire. Or find powerful and complex spells by defeating enemies and exploring the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/0f6ae6924c2c4968971333d33536045f.poster.avif?t=1788219693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/0f6ae6924c2c4968971333d33536045f.webm?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/0f6ae6924c2c4968971333d33536045f.mp4?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a diverse array of monsters, each with its own strengths and weaknesses. Use your mathematical prowess to outmaneuver and defeat them, and claim their essence to fuel your spellcraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/4630ab7b4c1b10eab1487e23fd321266.poster.avif?t=1788219693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/4630ab7b4c1b10eab1487e23fd321266.webm?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/4630ab7b4c1b10eab1487e23fd321266.mp4?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles and Unlock Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher spells dropped by enemies to learn new techniques (or just use them directly back at any other enemy). Combine and configure artifacts collected to create overpowered builds. But be careful as not all artifacts will provide you with benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling adventure in various procedurally generated open worlds, where magic and mathematics collide. In Spell Magic, you'll craft and master powerful spells using the fundamental forces of arithmetic, geometry, and algebra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a skilled <i>mathemagician</i>, you'll explore a vast, ever-changing realm, teeming with fearsome monsters and challenging puzzles. Your quest is to unravel the secrets of the mystical arts, harnessing the power of numbers to bend reality to your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Procedurally Generated Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you play, the world is reborn, offering a fresh experience. Various options to customize any new game are available. Options such as starting with any available upgrades or any amount of gold. Various modes all the way from permadeath to invincible exist with many more in-between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/48bf0f991c5223aa18b3a1ad3d1cff13.poster.avif?t=1788219693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/48bf0f991c5223aa18b3a1ad3d1cff13.webm?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/48bf0f991c5223aa18b3a1ad3d1cff13.mp4?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Your Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine mathematical concepts to create an arsenal of unique spells. Experiment with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geometric patterns for your shields and projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Algebraic equations to create perfectly placed elemental attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vector arithmetic to warp the 3rd dimension with your movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, learn new mathematical techniques and concepts to expand your spellcasting repertoire. Or find powerful and complex spells by defeating enemies and exploring the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/0f6ae6924c2c4968971333d33536045f.poster.avif?t=1788219693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/0f6ae6924c2c4968971333d33536045f.webm?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/0f6ae6924c2c4968971333d33536045f.mp4?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a diverse array of monsters, each with its own strengths and weaknesses. Use your mathematical prowess to outmaneuver and defeat them, and claim their essence to fuel your spellcraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/4630ab7b4c1b10eab1487e23fd321266.poster.avif?t=1788219693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/4630ab7b4c1b10eab1487e23fd321266.webm?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/extras/4630ab7b4c1b10eab1487e23fd321266.mp4?t=1788219693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles and Unlock Secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher spells dropped by enemies to learn new techniques (or just use them directly back at any other enemy). Combine and configure artifacts collected to create overpowered builds. But be careful as not all artifacts will provide you with benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Craft, cast, and master magical spells using mathematical concepts. Explore, battle, and solve puzzles in a thrilling adventure that combines arithmetic, geometry, and algebra with fast-paced action and strategy.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/header.jpg?t=1788219693", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/487cab6117abfa147d079662f9edad53ff34a617/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788219693", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427990/487cab6117abfa147d079662f9edad53ff34a617/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788219693", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 M